00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.820
<b>Episode 1

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.820
<b>Episode 1

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:58.200
Nyamero, watch over the place while I'm out.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.900
I'll bring you back a gift.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.460
Well, see you later.

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.020
<i>Today's my first day at my new job.</i>

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:13.940
<i>I'm finally a member of the workforce.</i>

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:18.260
<i>That said, I don't feel any different.</i>

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.500
<i>Ever since my school days...</i>

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.360
<i>Fuyutsuki-san is so stoic.</i>

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:28.240
Yeah, nothing fazes her.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:29.700
Totally!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.170
<i>That's what they always said.</i>

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:42.090
<i>Maybe I'm not as emotional as other people.</i>

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:00.560
Snow?

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.850
Are you... all right?

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:17.670
Did... something happen to your legs?

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.720
Oh, sorry.

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:25.280
Today's my first day at 
a new job, so I'm nervous.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.530
So now my legs are frozen
 and I'm trapped here.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:35.760
Looking at cherry blossoms calms me down.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.780
<i>What in the world?</i>

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:46.160
<i>I've heard of being too 
nervous to move, but...</i>

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:50.920
<i>I've never seen it result in 
someone literally freezing up.</i>

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.290
I know.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.790
I have some hot tea.

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:01.220
I'll pour that on it.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:02.550
You don't mind?

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.550
It's fine.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:09.710
<i>Nothing.</i>

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:13.120
<i>Just how nervous is this guy?</i>

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:23.970
Would you like some tea yourself?

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.120
Sure.

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.450
Here.

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:32.100
Thank you.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:32.910
It's nothing.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:38.460
<b>Konbu</b>

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:36.530
Here.

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:38.460
Thank you.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.230
Oh, it broke!

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:55.470
I'm glad.

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:02.880
Isn't spring nice?

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:09.740
The truth is... I'm actually
 descended from a snow woman.

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:13.120
A snow... woman?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.950
Yes, a snow woman.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:19.500
When I get emotional, I produce ice.

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:24.630
<i>I've never met anyone descended 
from... a yokai, I guess?</i>

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:28.060
Since I'm a descendant of a snow woman,

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.890
people often ask if I like winter.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:32.430
But...

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:38.630
The season when flowers bloom, 
and I meet new people...

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.010
I like spring, too.

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:52.990
Thank you for the tea.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:53.910
It's nothing, really.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:57.780
You helped relieve some of my nervousness.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:01.420
R-Right.

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:02.700
Goodbye.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:11.930
I'm going to be late.

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:14.970
<i>Isn't Fuyutsuki-san stoic?</i>

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.680
<i>Nothing startles her, ever.</i>

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:19.190
<i>She doesn't even get crushes, I bet.</i>

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:24.140
<i>I certainly was that way 
back in school, but...</i>

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.060
<i>Amazing.</i>

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:33.820
<i>I've already met someone 
unlike anyone I've ever known before.</i>

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.630
<i>I wonder if I'll see him again.</i>

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:45.250
<i>I've frozen up from nervousness 
many times before.</i>

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:48.860
<i>But...</i>

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.170
<i>I've never met anyone like her.</i>

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:54.910
<i>So kind and gentle...</i>

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:30.860
We're at the same company, then?

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:32.340
It appears so.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.260
I suppose coincidences do happen.

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:36.540
Yes...

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:38.790
Looks like we'll be colleagues.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:42.140
I look forward to working with you.

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:48.460
<i>What?!</i>

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:51.310
<i>Meeting again here is a freakin' miracle!</i>

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:57.170
Whoa, what?! What's going on here?!

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:04.670
Those look soft.

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:10.300
That's right! I'm a descendant 
of a fox spirit, actually!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.160
I see.

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:14.340
I'm a descendant of a snow woman.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.500
A snow woman, huh?

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:18.250
That's something else!

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:21.220
Oh, excuse me.

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:22.680
My name is Saejima.

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:25.520
Oh. I'm Himuro.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.560
I'm Fuyutsuki.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.820
I'm Komori!

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.820
Are you a descendant of anything?

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.570
I'm a descendant of humans.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.200
Same.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.680
Let's look after each other.

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:42.860
Agreed.

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:44.910
A pleasure.

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:48.710
Actually, there's something 
I've been wondering about...

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:50.840
The section chief there...

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:54.550
You think he's descended
 from the Great Buddha?

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.020
Of course not.

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:58.220
The Great Buddha is just a statue.

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:01.650
Guess it's just a close resemblance, then!

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:05.200
I'm back, Nyamero.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.730
It's bonito with scallops and sea bream.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:20.020
Nyamero.

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:22.320
I met so many kinds of people today.

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:27.180
I feel like I'm about to have 
all kinds of new experiences.

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:29.610
Oh, I know.

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:31.250
Your reward for watching the house...

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.740
I'm glad you like it.

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:45.790
Typical cat.

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.740
I can't wait for tomorrow!

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:20.430
Excuse me. Himuro-kun?

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.770
It's a bit cold.

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:23.680
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.060
I got a little fired up.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.810
You like flowers?

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:33.390
Yes, I love them.

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:38.020
But, since anything I approach freezes...

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:46.670
They frost over?

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:47.680
Yes.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.580
In other words, while I love flowers,

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:53.460
flowers will never love me back.

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.890
There must be a way.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.970
Right, Nyamero?

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:10.590
Himuro-kun.

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:17.480
<b>Straw Mulch</b>

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:17.480
You could try this.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.110
<b>Domestically Made - For Gardening</b>

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.110
<b>Straw Mulch</b>

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:20.900
Straw?

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:24.370
Fuyutsuki-san, what is this?

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:25.900
Straw mulch.

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:30.620
It's effective at preventing plants 
from dying to frost.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:35.060
It's sad to see both you 
and flowers suffering.

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:38.130
So I looked up potential ways 
to solve the problem.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:40.570
Excuse me, Fuyutsuki-san?

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:41.360
Yes?

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:44.390
Did you carry this with you
 on your commute?

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.470
Don't worry.

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:48.950
Out of consideration for
 my fellow commuters,

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.730
I took the first train out.

00:11:56.960 --> 00:12:00.150
Fuyutsuki-san. You're very kind.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:02.140
<i>He smiled.</i>

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:06.230
I'm glad to have helped.

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:07.230
Goodbye.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:16.670
<i>Aw, heck! Fuyutsuki-san's too nice!</i>

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:19.670
<i>I freakin' love her!</i>

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:22.580
<i>I think I might melt!</i>

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.460
H-Himuro-san?!

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:27.180
It's freezing!

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:39.500
Himuro-kun, what are you looking at?

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:41.860
Also, it's a bit cold.

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:45.180
I'm sorry, Fuyutsuki-san.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:46.810
I got a little fired up.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.200
<b></b>Trending Posts

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:48.650
A cat?

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:53.160
I really like cats,

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:55.360
but when I get excited, I create ice,

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:56.820
so I can't touch them.

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:08.380
So I was watching cat videos to calm down.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:12.360
Actually, I have a cat of my own.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:16.110
Cute!

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.930
I love real cats.

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:24.360
I wish I could pet one.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:36.500
Himuro-kun.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:42.500
You can have these, if you like.

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:45.750
They're whiskers.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:46.740
Whiskers?

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:51.450
I sometimes find my cat's 
whiskers on the floor.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:58.980
So I've been collecting them.

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:03.640
If you can't touch a real cat,

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:06.940
I thought you might at least 
like a real one's whiskers.

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:08.910
Fuyutsuki-san...

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:13.570
Cat whiskers are also a type
 of protective charm.

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:18.290
I thought they'd help make 
good things happen for you.

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:26.420
It's a little embarrassing to give 
a protective charm to a man, though.

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:29.370
Goodbye.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.360
<i>How freakin' cute can she get?!</i>

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:42.340
<i>Fuyutsuki-san wants me to be happy?!</i>

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.940
<i>The whiskers are already
 workin' way too well!</i>

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:49.660
Cat whiskers rock!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:54.440
Cat whiskers have him that hyped?

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:56.500
He must <i>really</i> love cats!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.520
Fuyutsuki-san.

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.830
How can ya be so nice?

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:06.450
Wish I could do somethin' 
nice for her, too...

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:14.330
Fuyutsuki-san.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:16.100
Dessert, if you'd like.

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:27.500
This is that popular limited-time item...

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:31.290
Chocolat orange pistache à la mode.

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:35.230
You mentioned once 
that you wanted to try it.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.740
<b></b>The latest hot-ticket item!

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:45.380
It's sold out everywhere, though.

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:48.880
Well... I just got lucky, is all.

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:54.260
<i>I c-can't tell her I spent a whole 
dang week searchin' for it!</i>

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:59.270
<i>I bet he searched all over 
to find it for me.</i>

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:03.760
Thank you very much.

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:07.740
<i>So freakin' cute!</i>

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:10.770
<i>I oughta be the one thankin' you!</i>

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:15.780
The snowman's cute, too.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:19.440
<i>Crud... I'm gettin' too happy!</i>

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:21.530
<i>I just wanted to pay her back a little,</i>

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:23.930
<i>but she's outdone me a million times over!</i>

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:26.590
Whoa, Himuro-san! It's freezing, man!

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:32.750
It's nice that the weather's so pleasant.

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:35.490
Hey, Fuyutsuki-san...

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:39.930
You're like, <i>really</i> nice to
 Himuro-san, aren't you?

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:42.190
Am I?

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:43.590
I think I treat him normally.

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:48.810
Isn't Fuyutsuki-san a super nice person?

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:52.690
Cute...

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.230
But, ow!

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:57.100
I agree that Fuyutsuki-san is nice, but—

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:59.080
Ow! Ow!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:02.580
She's the nicest ever!

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:13.350
A snow hut?

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:17.890
Apparently he withdraws into a snow hut 
when he's feeling down.

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.380
He must have made some 
kind of mistake today.

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:26.210
It seems he lost the document 
data he spent all day on.

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:27.100
Section Chief?

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:30.280
I told him he could turn it in tomorrow,

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:31.790
but he said...

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:36.110
No, I'll have it done today.

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:38.610
...and refused to listen.

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:40.730
That sounds like him!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.470
You're working late tonight?

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:50.770
Fuyutsuki-san?

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:54.260
I made a terrible mistake.

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:58.010
Is there any way I can help?

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:07.720
No, I'll be fine.

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:09.770
I have to make up for my own mistake.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.770
I see.

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:14.530
I'll see you tomorrow, then.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:15.900
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:30.980
Don't overdo it.

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:32.290
Fuyutsuki-san!

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:33.810
Goodbye.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.390
<i>So freakin' cool!</i>

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:43.020
<i>She was worryin' for me!</i>

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:47.570
<i>She ain't just cute, she's got 
coolness goin' for her too!</i>

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:56.690
Saejima-kun.

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:58.540
Your face looks rather red.

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:03.200
Yeah, I've got the beginnings 
of a cold and a fever.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:07.580
I see, but you shouldn't overload 
yourself. Why not head home?

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:09.880
I'd love to, but...

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:15.210
<b></b>Company Project List

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:15.210
I've still got a ton left to do.

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.490
I'll make you something nice, then.

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:19.590
Something nice?

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:23.340
A homemade compress patch.

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:27.020
I don't think that'll stick...

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.410
I'll pass.

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:30.480
You could wrap it around.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.640
Wrap a towel around 
my head? While I'm in a suit?

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:35.060
I'd rather not.

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:36.480
I'd look drunk.

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:38.900
You're being stubborn.

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:41.610
Really, I'm fine.

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:43.480
Give me this packet, then.

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:43.700
<b></b>Company Project List

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:44.350
<b></b>Company Project List

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:47.560
Taking care of your health 
is an important part of the job.

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:50.320
I'll help so you can head home early.

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:52.640
Thanks.

00:19:57.980 --> 00:20:00.020
<i>He took almost everything.</i>

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:05.370
You're a kind person, Himuro-kun.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:06.840
Not at all, Fuyutsuki-san.

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:09.510
I can handle this easily.

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:11.790
Colleagues should look out for each other.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:13.100
I see.

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:24.470
<i>She said I was nice!</i>

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:32.160
<i>He might create cold things, 
but he's got a warm heart.</i>

00:20:33.010 --> 00:20:33.830
Ow!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.670
Oh, sorry.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.810
I'm back, Nyamero.

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:43.170
Were you good while I was away?

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:51.310
You finally went inside it!

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:07.450
You'll go in there again, I bet.

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:13.450
It's been a full month since then.

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:19.090
I've been at the company for a whole month.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:30.630
Fuyutsuki-san's so darn nice.

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:33.490
I sure picked a great company to join!

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:35.730
I love bein' an adult!

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:38.270
Fuyutsuki-san...

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:44.610
We've picked the location 
for the new employee workshop.

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:46.280
It's Okinawa!

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:47.520
Okinawa?

00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:48.360
Yeah!

00:21:48.730 --> 00:21:50.030
Sounds great!

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:54.370
<i>O-O-Okinawa?</i>

00:21:58.620 --> 00:22:00.250
<i>No...</i>

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:04.130
<i>Somethin' awful's gonna happen 
if I go to Okinawa!</i>
